:''Not to be confused with [[Shinji Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Shinji Cat]].''
'''Shinji & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event#Evangelion Activates!|Evangelion Activates!]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]] gains increased health and damage, [[Resistant|Resistance]] against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] and [[Zombie Killer]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 402
|rarity = RR
