|name3 = Plug Suit Shinji Black
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Plug Suit Shinji''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Plug Suit Shinji Black''' when obtained from the [[EVA Unit-13 Strikes!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Shinji & Cat is a decent starting cat for killing [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angels]] with slow attack speed. However, Angels such as [[The 4th Angel (Enemy)|The 4th Angel]] outrange and attack before Shinji can attack, in addition to knocking him back, thus he won't be able to attack them. While weak, his [[Cat Combo]] with [[Kaworu & Cat (Special Cat)|Kaworu &amp; Cat]] is phenomenal, but is unfortunately only useful during the event.

Outside of EVA Angel enemies, this Cat won't be used for much. Due to its short range of 160, the best Shinji & Cat can do is boost your [[User Rank]], as they are not spammable enough to be meatshields.

==='''True Form'''===
Shinji & Cat receives many notable boosts when upgrading to their True Form: Doubled health, increased attack, and [[Resistant|Resistance]] to [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]]/[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], and [[Zombie Killer]].

This gives Shinji a major boost, however, despite this, his cooldown still keeps him from being a proper tank outside of EVA Angels.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & Combo Slave}}

